--- !u!114 &169447706
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 169447705}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e1bb02c8da6200b48aeb104391660cbd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcDialoguePanel: {fileID: 974404153}
  npcDialogueText: {fileID: 91827463}
  playerDialoguePanel: {fileID: 275550059}
  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 585681363}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Who are you? And why did you save me from Alice?
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "My name is Cecilia, Alice\u2019s twin sister. The reason I saved you is
      that I hope you can end this nightmare."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "What? End this nightmare? I almost lost my life back there. Without your
      help, I\u2019d already be gone."
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "I couldn\u2019t stand watching the souls trapped here being tortured any
      longer. I want this to end. I want you to escape this place and stop the curse
      entirely."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "But I thought destroying the cursed items would end it? Are you saying
      that\u2019s not enough?"
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "Correct. Even if the cursed items are destroyed, the evil tied to them
      doesn\u2019t fade completely. I\u2019ve tried to end this before, but my plans
      were discovered, and I failed."
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "That\u2019s why I\u2019ve been hiding, hoping for another chance. If you\u2019ve
      realized it, we\u2019ve met before."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "What? Wait... now it makes sense. The girl at the Hayes\u2019 second hall
      in the music room!"
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: Yes... that was me.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "You pretended all that time? Wait... that means\u2014you\u2019re the \u2018Milady\u2019
      of this house!"
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "... Correct. But it\u2019s been a painful title. Nobody ever used my
      name, not even my parents. They all just called me \u2018Milady.\u2019
      After things went wrong, I escaped and went into hiding, found by Mr. Jacob."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "If you\u2019re here, won\u2019t the mansion\u2019s shadows come for you?"
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "They will. But our problem right now is escaping this floor. It\u2019s
      already flooded with shadows, and the only way out is by unlocking the safe
      vault to get the key."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "... Alright. I\u2019ll help us get out of here."
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: Thank you, Hazil, for helping me put an end to this curse.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "It\u2019s too early to celebrate. Let\u2019s focus on escaping first."
  npcContButton: {fileID: 1308669987}
  playerContButton: {fileID: 488174742}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
