  dialogue:
  - speaker: Alice
    line: "Mister, there\u2019s a door in front of us! Maybe we can leave this place."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Huh? There\u2019s no trap or riddle like before?"
  - speaker: Alice
    line: Why overthink it? We can just leave this place!
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Hmm... (This feels off... is it just my imagination, or is something wrong?)
  - speaker: Alice
    line: "Hurry, mister! Let\u2019s go!"
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "...Alright... (But I need to stay alert... this doesn\u2019t feel right.)"
