--- !u!114 &887623697
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 887623695}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e1bb02c8da6200b48aeb104391660cbd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcDialoguePanel: {fileID: 732195819}
  npcDialogueText: {fileID: 2091197255}
  playerDialoguePanel: {fileID: 1309465325}
  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 946300178}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Wow! Are these antique items?
  - speaker: Alice
    line: Yeah... it seems like they were stored here.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Weird, why are these items here? I thought all the antiques were kept in
      the basement.
  - speaker: Alice
    line: "I don\u2019t know about that. Should we just leave them? They\u2019re
      displayed here for a reason, right?"
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Hmm... (Mr. Jacob mentioned that two artifacts went missing... could these
      be the ones?)
  - speaker: Alice
    line: Hazil? Are you okay? You seem lost in thought.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Oh, sorry about that. I was just thinking... it\u2019s odd for these items
      to be displayed here instead of in the antique room."
  - speaker: Alice
    line: Antique room?
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Yeah, the place where Mr. Jacob looks after the Hayes family\u2019s collection."
  - speaker: Alice
    line: Ah, I see. I came here with my family during the Hayes gathering. I remember
      seeing him around at the time.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: (Was that during the famous gathering in the 1970s?)
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "(That would mean... everyone I\u2019ve been meeting here is already dead...)"
  - speaker: Alice
    line: "Well, enough of that. Let\u2019s move along; it\u2019s just some display
      here."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: ...Okay...
  npcContButton: {fileID: 1717196348}
  playerContButton: {fileID: 2584477}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  playerMovement: {fileID: 593813604}
  npcManager: {fileID: 0}
